<h1>Jeanette Taylor</h1>
<p>20th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Is running for what she said will be her final term on the City Council, WTTW reported in August 2026. No campaign website or detailed platform found yet.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>20th Ward alderwoman since 2019; community organizer with the Kenwood Oakland Community Organization and longtime Mollison Elementary local school council member who led the 2015 hunger strike against the proposed closure of Dyett High School.</p>
